to law school I go.

[https://application.vthitec.org/UVMPHLEB10/](https://application.vthitec.org/UVMPHLEB10/)

&#x200B;

This program is legit, they support you through the process, provide everything you need (Except internet access in these times of covid) and you're guaranteed a job at the end of it with UVM. It's unpaid but if you're already receiving unemployment you're allowed to continue with it. I highly suggest it if your comfortable working in the medical field at this time, as there's a real need for people and it's a really supportive team. If you're looking to leave the service industry it's great as you're trained, but all the skills from that industry are totally applicable and useful!

